  "private": true,
  "description": "The finance domain module — Receipt → Expense → Category → Vendor → Reports → Accounting export (Kevin's Receipt/Expense/OCR/Accounting mandate, Oct 21 2026). The ONE authority for expenses, bills and reimbursements. Depends on packages only; consumed compiled by apps/api.",
